# Targeting through the real keys (owner, 2026-09-16): every body carries its
# wordless tag; holding Z locks the nearest threat, leans the camera in behind
# the player and reads the body on the slate; a and d cycle the lock; r sweeps
# the whole field and stands the camera back; letting go puts it all away. And
# a fight is fought with the key held, because targeting never was required.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/targeting.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
wait 0.8

# --- a body, and the tag it carries without anybody asking -----------------------
spawn runner
wait 0.8
shot 01-a-machine-carries-its-tag with mob:runner

# --- the lock: the camera leans in and the slate reads it -------------------------
hold target
await target 5
await target_lean 5
wait 0.9
shot 02-locked-the-camera-leans with mob:runner

# --- another body, and the lock cycled onto it ------------------------------------
spawn cutter
wait 0.6
shot 03-a-second-machine with mob:cutter,mob:runner
tap move_right
wait 0.5
await target 3
shot 04-cycled-to-another with mob:cutter,mob:runner

# --- the field swept: the camera stands back and every body is read ---------------
tap ability_scan
await target_sweep 5
wait 0.9
shot 05-the-field-swept with mob:runner,mob:cutter
tap ability_scan
wait 0.5
await target 3

# --- a fight, with the key still held ---------------------------------------------
walkto part 6
press swing
await hit 6
wait 0.3
shot 06-fought-while-reading with mob:runner

# --- let go: the camera comes back square and the reads go ------------------------
release target
await target_none 5
wait 1.2
shot 07-let-go-and-square with mob:runner
